    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Euphionia: The Tree Spirit's Curse is an old school grid-based dungeon crawler, with combo oriented non-turn-based combat. Your objective is to collect the 6 orbs and escape from the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid-based mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 challenging rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Battle Encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Experience and Leveling System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple and easy and follow storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable Badges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items, shopping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Save anywhere&quot; (outside of battle!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of 3D environments and 2D gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Skolorie has been cursed and is set to wander the Fenmia Mushroom Forest for the rest of time! Can she defeat the odds and find a way out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
